1. Memory `cursor-bundle/memory/MEMORY.md`
2. Brain / CANONICAL-MAP
3. **LOOKUP first:** KG MCP (`trustt-kg`) — `kg_orient` / `kg_flow` / `kg_why` / `kg_impact` / `kg_fixed_elsewhere` (smallest query first; after validate/fresh)
